ion.federalregister.gov/2026-17365.pdf?1787661909"}, "title": "Pro Rata Share of Subpart F Income, Tested Income, or Tested Loss", "agency": "Internal Revenue Service", "source": "federal_register", "summary": "This document contains proposed regulations relating to the determination of a United States shareholder''s pro rata share of subpart F income, tested income, or tested loss of a controlled foreign corporation. The proposed regulations would affect shareholders of foreign corporations, including United States shareholders of controlled foreign corporations.", "category": "regulatory", "countries": [], "created_at": "2026-09-23T01:15:09.498411+00:00", "source_url": "https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/2026/08/26/2026-17365/pro-rata-share-of-subpart-f-income-tested-income-or-tested-loss", "external_id": "2026-17365", "duplicate_of": null, "jurisdiction": "Internal Revenue Service · Federal", "effective_date": null, "published_date": "2026-08-26", "on_public_inspection": false, "duplicates_checked_at": null}, {"id": "60fb65f8-ea9b-43ff-8c3c-8fc040faadbf", "raw": {"title": "Information Technology (Intermediary Guidelines and Digital Media Ethics Code) Amendment Rules, 2026 (G.S.R. 120(E))", "agency": "Ministry of Electronics and Information Technology (MeitY)", "summary": "Explicitly incorporates synthetically generated information (SGI) including AI-generated text, images, audio, and video into the due diligence obligations of intermediaries such as social media platforms, requiring labeling and detection of AI-generated content.", "source_url": "https://www.mondaq.com/unitedstates/new-technology/1748154/indias-2026-it-rules-amendment-regulating-ai-generated-content-and-accelerating-compliance", "jurisdiction": "India", "effective_date": "2026-02-20", "published_date": "2026-02-10"}, "title": "Information Technology (Intermediary Guidelines and Digital Media Ethics Code) Amendment Rules, 2026 (G.S.R. 120(E))", "agency": "Ministry of Electronics and Informa