8fcee3-a2ba-4bbc-9a47-ae7f1d9d5a14"}, {"id": "85eed1d2-4d5a-4edc-9f34-c1854078851a", "firm_id": "b3eb450e-1edf-4de6-94c9-9d18a48f14f2", "fund_id": null, "created_at": "2026-10-08T23:10:51.143406+00:00", "dismissed_at": null, "via_holdings": false, "regulation_id": "44ae3439-b711-43f7-bbc2-5c0ecfa218b5", "relevance_reason": "Direct: Rheintal Batterie GmbH (does: battery modules for electric vehicles and industrial storage, battery recycling) manufactures lithium-ion battery modules, which could involve processed critical minerals. This global import adjustment on processed critical minerals could affect the company if it imports such minerals, though the extent of its import activity is not recorded.", "portfolio_company_id": "1ae65692-f23c-4109-8064-72a34d27f2be"}, {"id": "dab0b319-f2d7-4193-9e9f-09cacdda9bd6", "firm_id": "b3eb450e-1edf-4de6-94c9-9d18a48f14f2", "fund_id": null, "created_at": "2026-10-08T00:27:12.44864+00:00", "dismissed_at": null, "via_holdings": false, "regulation_id": "e4202c28-7ab7-433e-badc-c2c1e7ef12cd", "relevance_reason": "UK Employment Rights Act 2025 commencement regulations apply to A.L.A. S.p.A., which operates in the United Kingdom and must comply with UK employment law.", "portfolio_company_id": null}, {"id": "1cb67b7e-497b-477d-8316-930e63d3e7c5", "firm_id": "b3eb450e-1edf-4de6-94c9-9d18a48f14f2", "fund_id": null, "created_at": "2026-10-08T00:27:12.44864+00:00", "dismissed_at": null, "via_holdings": false, "regulation_id": "887f9647-771b-4941-8ed6-f50d3b99578d", "relevance_reason": "FCA consultation on transaction reporting regime applies to H.I.G. Capital if it operates as a regulated firm in the United Kingdom; the firm''s profile indicates European operations and A.L.A. S.p.A. operates in the UK.", "portfolio_company_id": null}, {"id": "10f1ab95-46f0-46cf-9533-6088bcb1c427", "firm_id": "b3eb450e-1edf-4de6-94c9-9d18a48f14f2", "fund_id": null, "created_at": "2026-10-04T19:49:45.321365+00:00", "dismissed_at": null, "via_holdings": false, "regulation_id": "974480ef-fc84-4518-aa5c-75c765510c63", "relevance_reason": "This case involves a private fund adviser misusing client fund assets and misrepresenting fund values to investors, similar to H.I.G. Capital''s role as an SEC-registered investment adviser managing private funds.", "portfolio_company_id": null}, {"id": "e0c0c8b1-0489-4241-80b4-a175475d5f75", "firm_id": "b3eb450e-1edf-4de6-94c9-9d18a48f14f2", "fund_id": null, "created_at": "2026-10-04T19:49:45.321365+00:00", "dismissed_at": null, "via_holdings": false, "regulation_id": "d8dcfb58-d781-4ab1-aab7-c5fc505f33e5", "relevance_reason": "This case involves a venture capital firm employee misappropriating investor money from private funds, similar to H.I.G. Capital''s role managing private equity funds.", "portfolio_company_id": null}, {"id": "eab8a239-26c4-4c6a-995f-bff713e37dfc", "firm_id": "b3eb450e-1edf-4de6-94c9-9d18a48f14f2", "fund_id": null, "created_at": "2026-10-07T00:40:06.170814+00:00", "dismissed_at": null, "via_holdings": false, "regulation_id": "b140ae5f-7886-4c00-9255-1b9c7d2b22c2", "relevance_reason": "This case involves cherry-picking allocation practices by a registered investment adviser managing client portfolios, similar to H.I.G. Capital''s role as an SEC Registered Investment Adviser managing multiple funds and making investment allocation decisions.", "portfolio_company_id": null}, {"id": "7a55cc4f-e779-4483-92fb-992c55712683", "firm_id": "b3eb450e-1edf-4de6-94c9-9d18a48f14f2", "fund_id": null, "created_at": "2026-10-04T03:02:02.259131+00:00", "dismissed_at": null, "via_holdings": false, "regulation_id": "3b05538e-9fd8-4319-9a4e-011627649cc1", "relevance_reason": "A.L.A. S.p.A. (Advanced Logistics for Aerospace) is recorded as doing mission-critical logistics and distribution services for aerospace and defense manufacturers, specifically logistics and supply chain management for aerospace components. This global measure on imports of commercial aircraft, jet engines, and aircraft and engine parts could affect A.L.A.''s logistics and distribution activities for aerospace components if any of those components are imported into the United States, though the specific volumes and sourcing are not recorded.", "portfolio_company_id": "51973b66-f862-464c-9a81-abdc54bbfd7c"}, {"id": "1cb43a35-4699-428c-8d8f-fa1962e14fe7", "firm_id": "b3eb450e-1edf-4de6-94c9-9d18a48f14f2", "fund_id": null, "created_at": "2026-10-08T22:57:14.321647+00:00", "dismissed_at": null, "via_holdings": false, "regulation_id": "3f39e5e3-c826-4d2c-9517-89318ec05201", "relevance_reason": "Indirect: Rheintal Batterie GmbH (test) has key suppliers in China; this conforming amendment relates to Section 301 tariffs on Chinese goods, which could affect the cost of components or materials sourced from those suppliers if they fall within the covered categories. The specific products covered by the exclusion amendment are not detailed.", "portfolio_company_id": "1ae65692-f23c-4109-8064-72a34d27f2be"}, {"id": "470f5201-6600-40fd-9a3c-0519cf2a34a3", "firm_id": "b3eb450e-1edf-4de6-94c9-9d18a48f14f2", "fund_id": null, "created_at": "2026-10-08T22:57:14.321647+00:00", "dismissed_at": null, "via_holdings": false, "regulation_id": "459d3a24-8781-4eb4-8d0e-29f4fe192b45", "relevance_reason": "Indirect: Rheintal Batterie GmbH (test) has key suppliers in China; these conforming amendments relate to Section 301 product exclusions from tariffs on Chinese goods, which could affect the cost of materials sourced from those suppliers if the excluded products are relevant to battery manufacturing. The specific products are not detailed.", "portfolio_company_id": "1ae65692-f23c-4109-8064-72a34d27f2be"}, {"id": "f023393b-6de8-4451-a7ab-2fd322f24b96", "firm_id": "b3eb450e-1edf-4de6-94c9-9d18a48f14f2", "fund_id": null, "created_at": "2026-10-08T22:57:14.321647+00:00", "dismissed_at": null, "via_holdings": false, "regulation_id": "78c3fd58-6213-4ba1-ab78-3279e0eb72ae", "relevance_reason": "Indirect: Rheintal Batterie GmbH (test) has key suppliers in China and operates there; this request for comments on a reciprocal managed trade mechanism with China could affect bilateral trade terms and tariff treatment for products sourced from or involving China, though the specific impact depends on the mechanism''s final design and product scope.", "portfolio_company_id": "1ae65692-f23c-4109-8064-72a34d27f2be"}, {"id": "569e65e4-6772-445e-a726-a9a46eddf7b4", "firm_id": "b3eb450e-1edf-4de6-94c9-9d18a48f14f2", "fund_id": null, "created_at": "2026-10-08T22:57:14.321647+00:00", "dismissed_at": null, "via_holdings": false, "regulation_id": "8e2859cd-f970-42dc-8611-66da06df3e7c", "relevance_reason": "Indirect: Rheintal Batterie GmbH (test) has key suppliers in China and operates there; this second four-year review of Section 301 actions on China could result in modifications to tariffs on Chinese goods, which could affect the cost of components sourced from those suppliers. The review''s outcome is not yet determined.", "portfolio_company_id": "1ae65692-f23c-4109-8064-72a34d27f2be"}, {"id": "591e192a-8482-4fc4-a2e4-5f3b2a4636b9", "firm_id": "b3eb450e-1edf-4de6-94c9-9d18a48f14f2", "fund_id": null, "created_at": "2026-10-04T19:50:02.417857+00:00", "dismissed_at": null, "via_holdings": false, "regulation_id": "ef0106c7-0efd-4ec8-86aa-670d6e146df9", "relevance_reason": "GetixHealth provides revenue cycle management services including medical billing, insurance claims management, and patient eligibility verification for hospitals and healthcare providers, which are directly affected by Medicare IPPS payment rates, quality program requirements, and health IT standards that govern hospital reimbursement and claims processing.", "portfolio_company_id": "6c0572f0-c971-4219-aeb2-9ec37339079f"}, {"id": "294c5298-759d-4694-88fa-dc7675dc4dda", "firm_id": "b3eb450e-1edf-4de6-94c9-9d18a48f14f2", "fund_id": null, "created_at": "2026-10-06T03:10:11.619353+00:00", "dismissed_at": null, "via_holding